ession_ratio": 1.5745614035087718, "no_speech_prob": 0.016657428815960884}, {"id": 28, "seek": 16204, "start": 172.68, "end": 178.56, "text": " that in the prime of the life, 20s, 30s, 40s hit the wall.", "tokens": [50895, 326, 287, 262, 6994, 286, 262, 1204, 11, 1160, 82, 11, 1542, 82, 11, 2319, 82, 2277, 262, 3355, 13, 51189], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17089061946659298, "compression_ratio": 1.5745614035087718, "no_speech_prob": 0.016657428815960884}, {"id": 29, "seek": 16204, "start": 178.56, "end": 180.2, "text": " And the wheelchair is the only option.", "tokens": [51189, 843, 262, 27181, 318, 262, 691, 3038, 13, 51271], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17089061946659298, "compression_ratio": 1.5745614035087718, "no_speech_prob": 0.016657428815960884}, {"id": 30, "seek": 16204, "start": 180.2, "end": 186.78, "text": " But it's also the aging population that is multiplying in numbers, and the only option", "tokens": [51271, 887, 340, 338, 635, 262, 14736, 3265, 326, 318, 48816, 287, 3146, 11, 290, 262, 691, 3038, 51600], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17089061946659298, "compression_ratio": 1.5745614035087718, "no_speech_prob": 0.016657428815960884}, {"id": 31, "seek": 18678, "start": 186.78, "end": 192.22, "text": " pretty much, whether it's stroke or other complications, is the wheelchair.", "tokens": [50363, 2495, 881, 11, 1771, 340, 338, 14000, 393, 584, 19481, 11, 318, 262, 27181, 13, 50635], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1709410499123966, "compression_ratio": 1.471111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.2503111958503723}, {"id": 32, "seek": 18678, "start": 192.22, "end": 197.82, "text": " And that is actually for the last 500 years, since it's a very successful introduction", "tokens": [50635, 843, 326, 318, 1682, 329, 262, 938, 5323, 812, 11, 1201, 340, 338, 257, 845, 4388, 9793, 50915], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1709410499123966, "compression_ratio": 1.471111111111111, "no_speech_prob": 0.2503111958503723}, {"id": 33